    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Large imposing Village Centre Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Large imposing Village Centre Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The property occupies a very visible strategic location on the Main Street in Drimoleague, \r\nThe Period style Townhouse building was once home of a very busy Post Office and residential home.\r\nStone built, c.1920's, having a Westerly aspect,  the accommodation consists of Sitting Room, Dining, Kitchen/Utility, on the ground floor. \r\nThe first floor has a Large Open Landing, 6 Bedrooms, Main Bathroom..High ceilings give  the feel of brightness, light, and space throughout.\r\nTo the rear of the property, there is a large garden/separate side entrance, running the full length of the side street, giving great potential for further\r\ndevelopment over time.   Outbuildings consist of a decorative greenhouse, fuel store/coal store, storage/outbuildings.\r\nCar Parking on the adjoining side street or alternatively the large Public Car Park across the road.\r\nThe property could be transformed with modernisation, a working hub, accommodation unit for the large number of walkers who frequent the area,   potential for retail on the ground floor, residential upstairs, the opportunity is endless.\r\nServices : Mains Sewage, Mains Water, Solid Fuel Range\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
